{
  "title": "Cambiar el denominador también cambia el numerador",
  "steps": [
    {
      "say": "Vas muy bien: te diste cuenta de que hacían falta sextos. Pero escribiste dos sextos, y ahí está el detalle.",
      "draw": [
        {"op": "frac", "num": "1", "den": "2", "x": 110, "y": 100, "size": 46},
        {"op": "write", "text": "+", "x": 170, "y": 116, "size": 52, "anchor": "middle"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "1", "den": "3", "x": 230, "y": 100, "size": 46},
        {"op": "write", "text": "=", "x": 290, "y": 116, "size": 52, "anchor": "middle"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "2", "den": "6", "x": 350, "y": 100, "size": 46, "color": "rojo"},
        {"op": "circle", "cx": 350, "cy": 100, "rx": 46, "ry": 62, "color": "rojo"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "Un medio es la mitad de la barra. Si la parto en seis pedazos, la mitad ya no es un pedazo: son tres.",
      "draw": [
        {"op": "bar", "x": 80, "y": 200, "w": 480, "h": 56, "parts": 2, "shade": 1, "color": "azul"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "1", "den": "2", "x": 640, "y": 228, "size": 40, "color": "azul"},
        {"op": "bar", "x": 80, "y": 290, "w": 480, "h": 56, "parts": 6, "shade": 3, "color": "azul"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "3", "den": "6", "x": 640, "y": 318, "size": 40, "color": "azul"},
        {"op": "arrow", "x1": 320, "y1": 262, "x2": 320, "y2": 284, "color": "rojo"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "Es como cambiar un billete de cincuenta por monedas: no te dan una moneda, te dan varias. Lo que multiplicas abajo, lo multiplicas arriba.",
      "draw": [
        {"op": "frac", "num": "1×3", "den": "2×3", "x": 150, "y": 450, "size": 42, "color": "azul"},
        {"op": "write", "text": "=", "x": 240, "y": 466, "size": 50, "anchor": "middle"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "3", "den": "6", "x": 310, "y": 450, "size": 42, "color": "azul"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "1×2", "den": "3×2", "x": 520, "y": 450, "size": 42, "color": "verde"},
        {"op": "write", "text": "=", "x": 610, "y": 466, "size": 50, "anchor": "middle"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "2", "den": "6", "x": 680, "y": 450, "size": 42, "color": "verde"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "Ahora sí: tres sextos más dos sextos son cinco sextos.",
      "draw": [
        {"op": "clear"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "3", "den": "6", "x": 160, "y": 140, "size": 50},
        {"op": "write", "text": "+", "x": 230, "y": 158, "size": 56, "anchor": "middle"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "2", "den": "6", "x": 300, "y": 140, "size": 50},
        {"op": "write", "text": "=", "x": 370, "y": 158, "size": 56, "anchor": "middle"},
        {"op": "frac", "num": "5", "den": "6", "x": 440, "y": 140, "size": 50, "color": "verde"},
        {"op": "circle", "cx": 440, "cy": 140, "rx": 48, "ry": 66, "color": "verde"},
        {"op": "bar", "x": 80, "y": 280, "w": 480, "h": 56, "parts": 6, "shade": 5, "color": "morado"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "Tu turno. Explícame: si cambio medios por sextos, ¿por qué el uno de arriba se vuelve tres?",
      "draw": [
        {"op": "write", "text": "¿Por qué 1/2 = 3/6? Explícalo", "x": 80, "y": 460, "size": 38, "color": "azul"}
